      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "盗み出された俺の黄金の兜を取り戻しては\nもらえぬだろうか。留守中のこととはいえ、\nこのようなことを放置していては\n俺の威厳にかかわるのでな。",
        "official_en": "Would you get back my stolen Golden Helm?\nIt happened while I was away, but still, I can't stand\nthe indignity of losing it to some bandit.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
